          "directionText": "Give all parties access to all documents sent to the court, including:\n\n- the application form\n- annex documents\n- evidential checklist documents\n- any documents sent later on\n",
          "directionType": "Send documents to all parties",
          "directionNeeded": "Yes",
          "directionRemovable": "Yes"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "6fe88f5e-7de7-42c6-a387-4005f9fbcf14",
        "value": {
          "assignee": "LOCAL_AUTHORITY",
          "readOnly": "No",
          "directionText": "- Social work chronology\n- Social work statement\n- Family tree (genogram)\n- Social work assessment\n- Care plan\n- Threshold document\n- Index of checklist documents\n",
          "directionType": "Send missing annex documents to the court and all parties",
          "directionNeeded": "Yes",
          "directionRemovable": "Yes"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "a7366ca9-5738-4ed0-b8d3-f92585fdafa1",
        "value": {
          "assignee": "LOCAL_AUTHORITY",
          "readOnly": "Yes",
          "directionText": "Contact the parents to make sure there is a complete family tree showing family members who could be alternative carers.",
          "directionType": "Identify alternative carers",
          "directionNeeded": "Yes",
          "directionRemovable": "Yes"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "4d95b445-ad4b-460a-aa80-b3a34a97ed6a",
        "value": {
          "assignee": "LOCAL_AUTHORITY",
          "readOnly": "No",
          "directionText": "Send documents to [Respondent's Name] in [Language], including the application and genogram.\n\nThis must include documents that the local authority relies on to support allegations and explain why they have made their application for an order.\n",
          "directionType": "Send translated case documents to respondents",
          "directionNeeded": "Yes",
          "directionRemovable": "Yes"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "37230f4a-e389-41db-abc6-6e305218211e",
        "value": {
          "assignee": "LOCAL_AUTHORITY",
          "readOnly": "Yes",
          "directionText": "It must comply with practice direction 27A from Family Procedure Rules 2010.",
          "directionType": "Lodge a bundle",
          "directionNeeded": "Yes",
          "directionRemovable": "Yes"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "2e76d29f-68c7-4eaf-953b-cec521f06971",
        "value": {
          "assignee": "LOCAL_AUTHORITY",
          "readOnly": "Yes",
          "directionText": "Send to the court and all parties.",
          "directionType": "Send case summary to all parties",
          "directionNeeded": "Yes",
          "directionRemovable": "Yes"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "858a8b07-e714-4bfb-bbfe-643b79dc2fa3",
        "value": {
          "assignee": "LOCAL_AUTHORITY",
          "readOnly": "No",
          "directionText": "The court has jurisdiction, based on all of the relevant law and facts, for example habitual residency. \n\nIf there is an issue, consider it urgently. Ask the relevant state authority for information needed to decide where jurisdiction lies. Bring this information to the case management hearing at .\n\nIf the child is a foreign national, tell the consulate or embassy in writing that these proceedings are happening. Invite any representations to be made to the court.\n",
          "directionType": "Urgently consider jurisdiction and invite any representations",
          "directionNeeded": "Yes",
          "directionRemovable": "Yes"
        }
      },
